    "id": "performance-ceiling-analysis",
    "kind": "skill",
    "entrypoint": "playbooks/measurement/performance-ceiling-analysis/SKILL.md",
    "title": "Estimate optimization headroom before modifying an inference system. Produces a three-level ceiling model (analytical, empirical component, end-to-end) and a prioritized measurement plan. Use to formulate acceptance targets when the user has not supplied them, assess a requested speedup, or identify the binding bottleneck.\n",
